00:15:22.724 --> 00:15:25.359
Tak perlu maaf. Namaku Tim.

00:15:25.426 --> 00:15:29.263
Banky Bear. Ini Texas Tim.

00:15:29.329 --> 00:15:30.998
Ini yang kuceritakan lewat pesan.

00:15:31.064 --> 00:15:33.400
Dia ikut kita malam ini.

00:15:34.234 --> 00:15:36.403
- Wah, bagus.
- Kurasa akulah orang

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:38.472
yang akan meniduri istrimu di depanmu.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.175
Oke, koboi. Tahan dulu machomu.

00:15:41.241 --> 00:15:43.578
Kalian ke sini untuk
bersenang-senang, kan?

00:15:44.144 --> 00:15:46.079
Dia bilang hal bodoh,

00:15:46.146 --> 00:15:47.549
sudah minta maaf,

00:15:47.615 --> 00:15:51.018
dan istrimu sudah mau lanjut, jadi...

00:15:51.084 --> 00:15:53.053
jangan buang waktu...

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.456
ayo kita berpesta.

00:16:16.911 --> 00:16:18.479
Banks.

00:16:18.546 --> 00:16:21.048
Sudah berlalu, ya?

00:16:21.114 --> 00:16:23.150
Aku cuma ingin melewati omong kosong

00:16:23.217 --> 00:16:25.520
dan bersenang-senang.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:30.190
Itu ganja.

00:16:30.257 --> 00:16:31.960
Aku tak merokok.

00:16:32.025 --> 00:16:34.328
Tapi terima kasih.

00:16:35.797 --> 00:16:38.432
Kau dari Skotlandia?

00:16:38.499 --> 00:16:40.467
Bukan.

00:16:40.535 --> 00:16:42.469
Punya keluarga di sana?

00:16:42.537 --> 00:16:43.705
Tidak.

00:16:43.771 --> 00:16:46.373
Itu bagian dari kostum <i>cosplay</i>-mu?

00:16:47.509 --> 00:16:49.611
Bukan.

00:16:58.051 --> 00:17:00.354
Saatnya masuk ke mesin waktu.

00:17:00.989 --> 00:17:02.189
Ikut?

00:17:02.256 --> 00:17:04.526
Memang rencananya begitu.

00:17:13.868 --> 00:17:16.971
- Stolleto! Bak air panas!
- Nanti saja.

00:17:17.037 --> 00:17:19.339
Baiklah. Aku bukan bapakmu.

00:17:23.443 --> 00:17:27.080
Jadi, bagaimana? Kita percaya dia?

00:17:27.147 --> 00:17:28.583
Santo?

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.451
Kuharap dia takkan
bilang begitu tentangku.

00:17:31.519 --> 00:17:33.821
Mungkinkah dia sekejam itu?

00:17:35.389 --> 00:17:37.725
Aku pernah dengar yang lebih buruk.

00:17:38.026 --> 00:17:41.228
Bukan tentangmu. Secara umum.

00:17:41.295 --> 00:17:42.797
Dia coba netral seperti Swiss,

00:17:42.864 --> 00:17:45.465
tapi bisa jadi mozzarella ala Machiavelli.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:01.181
- Apa?
- Boleh?

00:18:01.916 --> 00:18:04.018
Tidak boleh.

00:18:04.519 --> 00:18:07.989
Ini bukan bak airmu. Ini bak air kami.

00:18:08.056 --> 00:18:10.257
Itu bahkan bukan bak airnya.

00:18:10.324 --> 00:18:12.060
Ayolah, Kawan.

00:18:12.125 --> 00:18:13.995
Jangan dipermasalahkan.

00:18:14.062 --> 00:18:16.296
Dengan hormat, Kawan,

00:18:16.363 --> 00:18:18.666
isap kontol berlumur smegma.

00:18:29.176 --> 00:18:30.912
Baiklah!

00:18:30.979 --> 00:18:33.280
Dasar kalian.

00:18:41.221 --> 00:18:43.091
Aku akan kembali dan memakai ini,

00:18:43.156 --> 00:18:44.892
jadi jangan dikotori.

00:18:44.959 --> 00:18:46.861
Ya, oke, Chase.

00:18:46.928 --> 00:18:49.229
Aku serius.

00:19:27.035 --> 00:19:28.368
Apa?

00:19:28.435 --> 00:19:30.138
Aku tak bilang apa-apa.

00:19:30.203 --> 00:19:32.406
Tapi kau ingin. Kulihat bibir tipis

00:19:32.472 --> 00:19:34.075
bodohmu gemetar ingin bicara.

00:19:34.142 --> 00:19:38.946
Kau memang memboikot ulang tahunnya.

00:19:39.013 --> 00:19:40.882
- Hah?
- Ulang tahun Poppy.

00:19:40.948 --> 00:19:44.085
- Kau menolak datang.
- Aku tidak menolak.

00:19:44.152 --> 00:19:46.219
- Aku kerja.
- Bisa ambil cuti.

00:19:46.286 --> 00:19:47.789
Tidak bisa.

00:19:58.132 --> 00:20:00.434
Jangan sentuh.

00:20:13.915 --> 00:20:16.216
Jadi karena aku tak
datang ke ulang tahunnya

00:20:16.283 --> 00:20:19.620
karena tak bisa, kau kira
aku benar-benar menjelekkannya,

00:20:19.687 --> 00:20:21.656
padahal akulah yang

00:20:21.723 --> 00:20:24.058
baru membantunya mengambil TV barunya.

00:20:24.659 --> 00:20:27.929
Stolleto, bersikap baik sesaat

00:20:27.995 --> 00:20:30.698
bukan berarti kau tak
memakinya habis-habisan.

00:20:30.765 --> 00:20:33.835
Aku membantu tetangga
lansiaku membawa belanjaan

00:20:33.901 --> 00:20:37.337
kemarin, padahal tiap pagi

00:20:37.404 --> 00:20:38.706
aku berdoa agar dia

00:20:38.773 --> 00:20:41.274
tersedak permen Werther's Original.

00:20:42.476 --> 00:20:43.945
Kau memproyeksikan.

00:20:44.011 --> 00:20:45.947
Oh ya? Begitu kedengarannya?

00:20:46.013 --> 00:20:48.381
Ya. Jelas itu kebiasaanmu,

00:20:48.448 --> 00:20:50.484
jadi kau menuduhku begitu juga.

00:20:50.551 --> 00:20:52.086
Oh, begitukah?

00:20:52.153 --> 00:20:54.655
Chase, silakan terus
menjawab dengan pertanyaan,

00:20:54.722 --> 00:20:56.256
tapi itu tak mengubah fakta

00:20:56.323 --> 00:20:58.325
bahwa kau bajingan mabuk

00:20:58.391 --> 00:21:00.695
dan pergilah sana.

00:21:08.177 --> 00:21:10.580
Persetan kau, Italia sialan.

00:21:20.615 --> 00:21:22.917
- Mantap!
- Apa?

00:21:23.751 --> 00:21:25.052
Ya.

00:21:25.119 --> 00:21:26.854
Dia menonton, itu kesepakatannya.

00:21:26.921 --> 00:21:28.623
Ya, tapi dia...

00:21:28.689 --> 00:21:31.092
Apa? Kau kira dia mau apa?

00:21:31.159 --> 00:21:32.425
Latihan <i>stand-up</i>?

00:21:32.492 --> 00:21:34.796
Kau tak merasa itu aneh?

00:21:35.428 --> 00:21:36.931
Memang begitu kebiasaan kami.

00:21:36.998 --> 00:21:39.499
Aneh kalau aku merasa itu aneh.

00:21:41.836 --> 00:21:43.671
Lihat aku.

00:21:43.738 --> 00:21:46.874
Dia yang menontonmu, bukan sebaliknya.

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.345
- Begini...
- Astaga, Chase, lupakan.

00:21:52.412 --> 00:21:55.249
Itu kelihatan seperti alibi yang pas.

00:21:55.315 --> 00:21:58.052
Sudahlah. Aku mau berak.

00:21:58.119 --> 00:22:00.188
Aku suka berak protes.

00:22:00.254 --> 00:22:02.557
<i>Bersulang!</i>

00:22:50.437 --> 00:22:52.974
Astaga! Apa-apaan, James?

00:22:54.242 --> 00:22:56.376
Kau mengagetkanku.

00:22:56.577 --> 00:22:57.612
Kau baik-baik saja?

00:22:58.779 --> 00:23:01.115
- Tidak.
- Apa?

00:23:01.448 --> 00:23:03.050
Maksudmu apa?

00:23:03.117 --> 00:23:05.586
Kubilang padanya aku ingin...

00:23:08.089 --> 00:23:09.757
Tunggu, apa? Maksudmu apa?

00:23:09.824 --> 00:23:11.125
- Sudah kuduga.
- Apa?

00:23:11.192 --> 00:23:13.160
Sudah kuduga!

00:23:13.227 --> 00:23:15.329
Aku tahu kau meniduri dia!
Sialan kau!

00:23:19.499 --> 00:23:21.836
Tidak!

00:23:21.903 --> 00:23:23.137
Tidak!

00:23:28.542 --> 00:23:31.879
Sayang, kau cantik
dengan cara istimewa, tapi...

00:23:31.946 --> 00:23:33.347
Cuma itu?

00:23:33.413 --> 00:23:35.716
Aku tak tahu apa itu.

00:23:35.783 --> 00:23:37.718
Bisa jadi sesuatu.

00:23:37.785 --> 00:23:40.121
Itu memang sesuatu.

00:23:41.522 --> 00:23:43.557
Kita jenis yang berbeda.

00:23:54.368 --> 00:23:56.304
Memang.

00:23:56.370 --> 00:23:58.673
Bersenang-senanglah.

00:24:04.211 --> 00:24:06.013
Apa-apaan? Hei!

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.114
Hei!

00:24:12.887 --> 00:24:15.056
Ya Tuhan!

00:24:15.122 --> 00:24:17.358
Sayang! Banks.

00:24:17.425 --> 00:24:19.593
Banks!

00:24:19.660 --> 00:24:22.196
Sayang! Tolong!

00:24:22.263 --> 00:24:24.031
Tolong!

00:24:35.343 --> 00:24:37.912
Ya Tuhan, James! Hentikan!

00:24:37.979 --> 00:24:39.313
Jangan! Hentikan!

00:24:39.380 --> 00:24:40.514
Astaga!

00:24:40.581 --> 00:24:42.917
Sialan!

00:24:43.117 --> 00:24:44.285
Hentikan!

00:24:44.352 --> 00:24:45.619
Hei! Hentikan!

00:24:49.489 --> 00:24:50.524
Ya Tuhan!

00:24:56.030 --> 00:24:57.398
Ya Tuhan.

00:24:57.465 --> 00:24:59.567
Ya Tuhan, dia sudah mati.

00:24:59.633 --> 00:25:02.036
Dia mati!

00:25:02.103 --> 00:25:04.171
Dia mati.

00:25:04.238 --> 00:25:06.374
Ya Tuhan.

00:25:06.607 --> 00:25:08.709
Ini, ini!

00:25:08.776 --> 00:25:10.478
Plester mau kuapakan?

00:25:10.544 --> 00:25:12.079
Entah, aku cuma mau membantu.

00:25:12.146 --> 00:25:13.914
Dia mati, Chase mati.

00:25:13.981 --> 00:25:16.217
Aku cuma mau menghentikan James.

00:25:16.283 --> 00:25:18.452
Tunggu, kalian kenal orang ini?

00:25:18.519 --> 00:25:20.054
Ya.

00:25:20.121 --> 00:25:21.522
James.

00:25:21.589 --> 00:25:22.990
Di mana Ali?

00:25:23.057 --> 00:25:24.925
Mereka yang melakukannya.

00:25:24.992 --> 00:25:27.428
James, dia di mana? Dia baik-baik saja?

00:25:27.495 --> 00:25:28.596
Mereka pelakunya!

00:25:28.662 --> 00:25:29.997
Bukan salahku!

00:25:30.064 --> 00:25:32.400
Bukan salahku! Mereka yang melakukannya!

00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:34.535
- Mau ke mana?
- Hei!

00:25:34.602 --> 00:25:35.636
Telepon 911.

00:25:35.703 --> 00:25:36.937
Kembali ke sini!

00:25:37.004 --> 00:25:38.072
Banks!

00:25:38.139 --> 00:25:39.874
- Banks butuh bantuan!
- Tunggu.

00:25:39.940 --> 00:25:41.442
Poppy, berikan ponselnya.

00:25:41.510 --> 00:25:43.210
- Apa? Kenapa?
- Jangan telepon dulu.

00:25:43.277 --> 00:25:45.012
- Tolong, ponselnya.
- Tunggu. Kenapa?

00:25:45.079 --> 00:25:46.714
- Harus!
- Oke, tapi tunggu.

00:25:46.781 --> 00:25:47.581
Tunggu, Poppy.

00:25:47.648 --> 00:25:49.518
Banks!

00:25:49.583 --> 00:25:51.585
Tunggu, Poppy, tolong!
Banks!

00:25:51.652 --> 00:25:53.020
Poppy, tolonglah.

00:25:53.087 --> 00:25:55.022
- Poppy.
- Banks!

00:25:55.089 --> 00:25:57.425
Poppy, tolong, aku perlu ponselnya.

00:25:57.491 --> 00:25:59.493
- Poppy!
- Banks? Minggir!

00:25:59.560 --> 00:26:00.895
Poppy! Hentikan.

00:26:00.961 --> 00:26:02.630
Banks, kau di mana?

00:26:02.696 --> 00:26:05.199
Poppy, aku butuh ponselnya. Ayolah!

00:26:05.666 --> 00:26:07.334
- Kumohon!
- Stolleto, apa-apaan?

00:26:07.401 --> 00:26:08.636
Kita harus panggil polisi.

00:26:08.702 --> 00:26:10.771
Oke, tapi...

00:26:10.838 --> 00:26:13.774
Poppy, mereka akan memulangkanku.

00:26:13.841 --> 00:26:15.276
Mereka takkan biarkan aku tinggal.

00:26:15.342 --> 00:26:16.477
Kau paham tidak?

00:26:16.545 --> 00:26:18.045
Bisakah kita sepakat dulu

00:26:18.112 --> 00:26:19.613
apa yang dikatakan dulu?

00:26:19.680 --> 00:26:21.048
Maksudmu?

00:26:21.115 --> 00:26:22.883
Kita harus katakan yang sebenarnya.

00:26:22.950 --> 00:26:24.218
- Tidak.
- Harus.

00:26:24.285 --> 00:26:25.853
Tidak! Poppy, ponselnya!

00:26:25.920 --> 00:26:27.655
- Lepaskan!
- Poppy, ponselnya.

00:26:27.721 --> 00:26:28.956
Jangan, Poppy, <i>per favore.</i>

00:26:29.023 --> 00:26:30.591
- Berikan ponselnya.
- Sialan!

00:26:30.658 --> 00:26:32.393
Kembalikan ponselnya, Poppy!

00:26:32.460 --> 00:26:34.762
Kembalikan ponsel itu.

00:26:34.829 --> 00:26:36.130
Berikan ponselnya! Hentikan!

00:26:36.197 --> 00:26:37.298
Tidak!

00:26:45.072 --> 00:26:47.174
Oh!

00:26:48.642 --> 00:26:49.777
Apa-apaan itu?

00:26:49.844 --> 00:26:51.679
Dia... dia jatuh.

00:26:51.745 --> 00:26:54.115
- Apa?
- Dia jatuh.

00:26:54.181 --> 00:26:55.282
Astaga.

00:26:55.349 --> 00:26:58.219
Telepon 911, cepat!

00:26:59.753 --> 00:27:01.922
Hei, Poppy. Bertahanlah.

00:27:01.989 --> 00:27:03.991
Bertahanlah. Hei!

00:27:04.058 --> 00:27:06.494
Bertahanlah. Cepat telepon 911.

00:27:06.961 --> 00:27:08.597
- Dia jatuh.
- Poppy, hei.

00:27:08.662 --> 00:27:10.131
Bertahanlah. Poppy.

00:27:10.197 --> 00:27:12.299
Poppy! Telepon 911!

00:27:12.366 --> 00:27:14.503
Hei! Hei!

00:27:16.270 --> 00:27:18.405
Hei! Apa-apaan yang kau lakukan?

00:27:18.472 --> 00:27:20.941
Aku cuma mencoba merebut ponselnya,

00:27:21.008 --> 00:27:22.643
dia terus menunjuk, lalu jatuh.

00:27:22.710 --> 00:27:25.079
Hei. Dengar aku, bajingan.

00:27:25.146 --> 00:27:26.615
Ada mayat di dalam,

00:27:26.680 --> 00:27:28.015
dan satu lagi di luar.

00:27:28.082 --> 00:27:30.718
Kaulah penyebab keduanya.

00:27:30.784 --> 00:27:33.154
Jangan bergerak.

00:27:33.787 --> 00:27:34.788
Ah!

00:27:36.591 --> 00:27:37.791
Tidak. Tunggu. Mau apa...

00:27:37.858 --> 00:27:38.993
Hei, sialan kau!

00:27:41.896 --> 00:27:43.998
Oke, tunggu. Jangan telepon!

00:27:44.064 --> 00:27:45.567
Hei!

00:27:45.634 --> 00:27:47.935
Ponselku juga jangan.

00:27:48.002 --> 00:27:49.604
Kau sudah gila?

00:27:49.670 --> 00:27:51.338
Dan ponsel Poppy juga jangan.

00:27:51.405 --> 00:27:54.208
Kau bercanda?

00:27:55.644 --> 00:27:57.945
Sialan!

00:28:01.516 --> 00:28:02.551
- Oh! Jangan!
- Hei!

00:28:02.617 --> 00:28:04.785
Lepaskan aku!

00:28:04.852 --> 00:28:06.253
Kau tak paham!

00:28:06.320 --> 00:28:07.656
Banks itu psikopat!

00:28:07.755 --> 00:28:09.156
Ya, aku sudah menyadarinya.

00:28:09.223 --> 00:28:10.691
Bukan psikopat seperti

00:28:10.758 --> 00:28:12.159
<i>Back to the Future.</i>

00:28:12.226 --> 00:28:14.563
Maksudku <i>Back to the Future Part 2,</i>

00:28:14.629 --> 00:28:15.664
psikopat sungguhan.

00:28:15.729 --> 00:28:17.298
Dia akan mencoba membunuhku.

00:28:17.364 --> 00:28:19.400
Mungkin kita berdua.

00:28:19.466 --> 00:28:20.834
Kau tak percaya?

00:28:20.901 --> 00:28:23.437
- Dia sudah pernah membunuh.
- Apa?

00:28:23.505 --> 00:28:24.939
Dinyatakan membela diri,

00:28:25.005 --> 00:28:26.907
tapi keadaannya sangat mencurigakan,

00:28:26.974 --> 00:28:28.475
dan orang itu gila.

00:28:28.543 --> 00:28:30.044
<i>Cazzo.</i>

00:28:30.110 --> 00:28:31.546
Kawan, ini geng macam apa?

00:28:31.613 --> 00:28:32.947
Kau tahu ada orang

00:28:33.013 --> 00:28:34.583
yang jelas mampu membunuh,

00:28:34.649 --> 00:28:36.250
dan cukup satu momen

00:28:36.317 --> 00:28:37.484
sampai mereka kalap?

00:28:37.552 --> 00:28:39.753
- Seperti kau?
- <i>Cazzo.</i>

00:28:39.820 --> 00:28:41.322
<i>Cazzo!</i> Kita harus pergi!

00:28:41.388 --> 00:28:43.390
Orang itu kena PCP.

00:28:43.457 --> 00:28:45.159
Ini takkan berakhir baik.

00:28:45.226 --> 00:28:47.562
PCP apa maksudmu?

00:28:48.128 --> 00:28:50.764
Menurutmu "debu" maksudnya apa?

00:28:50.831 --> 00:28:52.166
Entahlah.

00:28:52.233 --> 00:28:53.668
Kukira maksudnya ganja lama

00:28:53.734 --> 00:28:55.069
yang dia simpan.

00:28:55.135 --> 00:28:57.938
Itu <i>angel dust,</i> dasar bodoh!

00:28:58.005 --> 00:28:59.507
Kita harus pergi sekarang!

00:28:59.574 --> 00:29:00.609
Percayalah.

00:29:00.675 --> 00:29:02.042
Aku tak percaya kau.

00:29:02.109 --> 00:29:04.378
Siapa tahu kalian bersekongkol?

00:29:04.445 --> 00:29:06.347
Hah?

00:29:07.881 --> 00:29:09.483
Astaga.

00:29:09.551 --> 00:29:10.685
Ayo, kita sembunyi.

00:29:20.861 --> 00:29:22.763
Kau mati!

00:29:22.830 --> 00:29:24.865
Akan kutemukan kau.

00:29:24.932 --> 00:29:27.535
Kau tak bisa sembunyi.

00:29:30.204 --> 00:29:32.306
Sekarang! Apa?

00:29:36.277 --> 00:29:37.679
Apa?

00:29:47.855 --> 00:29:49.823
Aku bisa mencium baumu.

00:29:49.890 --> 00:29:52.893
Aku bisa mencium baumu, bangsat.

00:29:58.499 --> 00:30:00.801
Sial.

00:30:01.468 --> 00:30:03.605
Ayo.

00:30:04.305 --> 00:30:05.973
Aku pergi dari sini.

00:30:13.447 --> 00:30:15.115
Buka kuncinya.

00:30:15.182 --> 00:30:17.084
- Kau membuang ponselku.
- Apa?

00:30:17.151 --> 00:30:19.654
Kau membuang ponselku.

00:30:19.721 --> 00:30:21.790
- Itu kunci mobilku.
- Maksudmu?

00:30:21.855 --> 00:30:23.057
Kau tak punya kunci?

00:30:23.123 --> 00:30:24.526
- Tidak.
- Kenapa?

00:30:24.592 --> 00:30:26.226
Tak ada kartu kunci juga?

00:30:26.293 --> 00:30:28.162
- Tidak kubawa.
- Kenapa tidak?

00:30:28.228 --> 00:30:29.764
Karena aku tak berencana

